<h1 id="experiments-header">Experiments</h1>

<section>
    <h2>Template Element</h2>
    <p>Stores an HTML element that isn't displayed immediately.</p>
    <template>
        <article>
            <p>This content is hidden inside of the template card.</p>
        </article>
    </template>
</section>

<section>
    <h2>Audio Element</h2>
    <p>Demonstrates how sound can be embedded into an HTML page.</p>
    <audio controls>
        <source src="/assets/media/barrelroll.mp3" type="audio/mpeg">
        Your browser doesn't support the audio element.
    </audio>
</section>

<section>
    <h2>Video Element</h2>
    <p>Demonstrates how videos can be embedded into an HTML page.</p>
    <video controls width="320">
        <source src="/assets/media/peak.mp4" type="video/mp4">
        Your browser doesn't support the video element.
    </video>
</section>

<section>
    <h2>Canvas Element</h2>
    <p>The canvas element creates a drawing area on the page.</p>
    <canvas id="experiment-canvas" width="300" height="150">
        Your browser does not support the canvas element.
    </canvas>
</section>

<section>
    <h2>Source Element</h2>
    <p>The source element provides different media files for the browser to choose from. It is commonly used inside video, audio, and picture elements.</p>
    <audio controls>
        <source src="/assets/media/supernatural.mp3" type="audio/mpeg">
        <source src="/assets/media/supernatural.wav" type="audio/wav">
        Your browser doesn't support the audio element.
    </audio>
</section>
